!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:start;
:v1: knows sla? ({Knows SLA, Does not know SLA}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "Does not know SLA"])
:look up;
else ([v1 = "Knows SLA"])
